# Route: guide 34 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 55 to
# 56, 76 quests, 2.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Felwood, Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, Thousand Needles, Stranglethorn
# Vale, Swamp of Sorrows, Undercity): Jaedenar -> Felpaw Village -> Jaedenar
# -> Felpaw Village -> near Orgrimmar -> Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar ->
# Orgrimmar -> Thunder Bluff -> near Thunder Bluff -> Thunder Bluff -> near
# Thunder Bluff -> The Shimmering Flats -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Shadowshard Fragments (7068;
# Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer
# 38); Arikara (5088; Arikara 28); The Star, the Hand and the Heart (736;
# Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig
# Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde! (4974), Returning the
# Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden Enemies (5728), Slaying
# the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing Tastes (95697),
# Changing Tastes (95697), Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102),
# Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723), Gahz'rilla (2770), The Book of Ur
# (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going,
# Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's
# Justice (92421), Light's Justice (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of
# Power (96988).

